    "diagnosis": "Diffuse paediatric-type high-grade glioma, H3-wildtype and IDH-wildtype, RTK1 subtype, in Lynch syndrome",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "This&nbsp;glial tumour of a 10-year-old child shows numerous pleomorphic giant cells. Genetic analysis revealed a germline <em>MSH2</em> mutation and a high tumour mutation burden. Methylation profiling indicated the RTK1 subtype. Immunohistochemistry showed MSH2/MSH6 loss in tumour cells, and retention in normal cells, compatible with Lynch syndrome.",
    "source": "David Capper",
    "copyright": "",
